#### 2.7.1. Update READ/STREAM routing to support “replica request”

We’ll extend the `MSG_READ` path: if the client sets `msg.ss_id == -2`, NM will return a replica instead of the primary. This is backward compatible: existing clients send `ss_id == -1` (default from `init_message`).

